  "assertions": [
    "Actual Coil loading, success, failure and retry/replacement callbacks with expected placeholder/result/error pixels; separate blue status sibling unchanged",
    "Controlled interceptor defers first and second requests; replacement and removing the image each cancel their own request",
    "Paused ShaderPlayback remains2.5 across model changes, retains explicit seek7.0 after removal; request status never recreates or seeks it",
    "TrackingFactory wraps actual ShaderSessions; all sessions close when image disappears before factory shutdown; no frame awaiters remain",
    "Actual local PNG decoder produces green output; same ImageLoader remount changes dataSource DISK -> MEMORY_CACHE",
    "Ordinary scroll-derived Grayscale intensity changes real decoded image pixels to~150 RGB without another load",
    "Compose tween240ms tested at1.0s/1.12s/1.4s on striped PNG; >100 interior pixels change at each interval, one successful request, retained.75 playback and settled frame scheduler",
    "Haze spatial blur crosses red/blue edge; grayscale overlay blends~33..72 RGB, visible source stays red and independent foreground green; registered source area count1 ->0 on removal",
    "Exact guide ImageRecipeScreen source compiles alongside optional consumer; responsive demo renders actual banner and surface at720x844 and390x844"
  ],
